 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Dead Evil Queen Elise"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "悪妃エリーゼは死にました"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Queen Elise, the young king’s rightful wife, couldn’t bear him an heir. Blamed for his failures and tormented by his cruel magic, she suffered terrible abuse. Everyone thought she died from her injuries, but she escaped.\n\nDisguised as a commoner, she hides her true identity and plots to destroy the tyrant king.\n\nIn a quiet town, a stableman named Flegel falls in love with her, not knowing who she really is. But he’s hiding a secret too.\n\nThis is the story of the so-called 'evil queen' and her short but unforgettable second life."
  },
